        "es": "Qwen-Code is an open-source AI agent that operates directly in your terminal, enabling developers to automate coding tasks without switching contexts. It leverages large language models to understand natural language commands and generate or modify code, with the technical insight being its seamless integration into existing development workflows through terminal-based interaction. You can use it to quickly generate boilerplate code, refactor existing files, or debug by describing issues in plain English, making it practical for accelerating daily development cycles.",
